\begin_layout Standard
Since the space of the candidates is artificially changed in familiar GP,
 it is to be expected that the performance is subject to the classic GP,
 but the familiar candidates should be more comprehensible, more similar
 to each other within a run and less volatile in real performance.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The familiar solutions were superior to the regular GP candidates in all
 respects, including the regression error, which is a big surprise in view
 of the reduced degree of freedom.
